<title>USA: Amer Intl wins bidding for Golden Eagle.</title>
<headline>Amer Intl wins bidding for Golden Eagle.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>American International Group Inc said it has been informed by the California Insurance Commissioner that it has won the bidding for Golden Eagle Insurance Co.</p>
<p>The company said it has begun working with the commissioner and his staff in preparation for taking over Golden Eagle.</p>
<p>It said it intends to establish a new company, to be named San Diego Casualty Co, to carry on the business.</p>
</text>
